<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('includes/head') %>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css"
    />

    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link href="styles/emergency.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include('includes/header') %>

    <section class="hero-container-box">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-badge emergency-pulse-badge">
            <span class="pulse-glow-dot"></span> 24/7 Critical Response Unit
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title text-white">
            Instant Emergency <br />
            Medical Support <br />
            When Seconds Count
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-text">
            In case of critical medical emergencies, speed saves lives. Our
            platform connects you instantly with immediate on-call emergency
            medical squads, trauma centers, and rapid ambulance dispatches in
            just a single click.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-footer d-flex align-items-center mt-5 flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:102" class="btn-emergency-hotline">
            <i class="fas fa-phone-flip me-2 shake-icon"></i> Call Ambulance
            (102)
          </a>

          <a
            href="/findhospital"
            class="btn-appointment"
            style="
              background-color: transparent;
              border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            "
          >
            Locate Trauma Center
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right-long ms-2 rotate-arrow"></i>
          </a>

          <div
            class="emergency-counter-box ms-lg-auto d-flex align-items-center gap-3 bg-white-5 p-3 rounded-4"
          >
            <div class="counter-item text-white border-end pe-3">
              <div class="fw-bold h5 mb-0" style="color: #ff4d4d">
                &lt; 12 Mins
              </div>
              <div class="small opacity-75" style="font-size: 11px">
                Avg Dispatch Time
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="counter-item text-white">
              <div class="fw-bold h5 mb-0 text-warning">250+</div>
              <div class="small opacity-75" style="font-size: 11px">
                Active Squads On-Road
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section py-5">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <div class="services-badge mb-3">
          <span class="dot-teal me-2"></span> Quick Dispatch Modules
        </div>
        <h2 class="services-main-title mb-5">
          Select Emergency Category For <br />
          Immediate Action
        </h2>

        <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
            <div
              class="service-card critical-alert-border"
              onclick="window.location.href = '/findhospital'"
            >
              <div class="service-card-top">
                <div class="service-icon alert-bg-red">
                  <i class="fas fa-heart-pulse"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="fw-bold h5 text-dark">Cardiac Care & Trauma</h3>
                <p class="small text-muted">
                  Instantly route highly specialized Advanced Life Support (ALS)
                  ambulances equipped with ventilators, monitors, and paramedics
                  to your exact location coordinates.
                </p>
              </div>
              <a href="/findhospital" class="view-details-btn btn-red-variant">
                Request ALS Unit
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right-long ms-2 rotate-arrow"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
            <div
              class="service-card"
              onclick="window.location.href = '/findhospital'"
            >
              <div class="service-card-top">
                <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-bed-pulse"></i></div>
                <h3 class="fw-bold h5 text-dark">ICU Bed Allocator</h3>
                <p class="small text-muted">
                  Query real-time database registers to locate open intensive
                  care beds and specialized ventilators across major hospitals
                  close to your zone.
                </p>
              </div>
              <a href="/findhospital" class="view-details-btn">
                Live Bed Count
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right-long ms-2 rotate-arrow"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
            <div
              class="service-card"
              onclick="window.location.href = '/pharmacy'"
            >
              <div class="service-card-top">
                <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-droplet"></i></div>
                <h3 class="fw-bold h5 text-dark">Emergency Blood Match</h3>
                <p class="small text-muted">
                  Locate immediate plasma, platelets, and whole blood units
                  across state blood banks and verified emergency volunteer
                  pools.
                </p>
              </div>
              <a href="/pharmacy" class="view-details-btn">
                Find Blood Stocks
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right-long ms-2 rotate-arrow"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how-it-works py-5">
      <div class="container core-features-box">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
          <div class="col-lg-5 mb-5 mb-lg-0">
            <div class="core-badge mb-3">
              <span class="dot-teal me-2"></span> Emergency Guide
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-white display-5 fw-bold mb-4">
              What To Do In A Crisis?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-white-50 mb-5">
              While our paramedics are en route to your destination tracking
              marker, execute these basic systematic protocols to preserve
              maximum patient safety.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-consultation">
              Call Support Desk
              <i class="fas fa-arrow-right-long ms-2 rotate-arrow"></i>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-7 ps-lg-5">
            <div class="row g-4">
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <div class="feature-icon bg-warning">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-heart"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="feature-info">
                    <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-1">
                      1. Stay Calm & Secure
                    </h6>
                    <p class="small text-white-50 mb-0">
                      Move the patient away from hazardous spaces into a
                      well-ventilated open area.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <div class="feature-icon bg-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-pin"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="feature-info">
                    <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-1">
                      2. Keep Location Open
                    </h6>
                    <p class="small text-white-50 mb-0">
                      Ensure your mobile GPS link stays active for accurate
                      ambient routing metrics.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <div class="feature-icon bg-info">
                    <i class="fas fa-kit-medical"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="feature-info">
                    <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-1">
                      3. Prepare Documents
                    </h6>
                    <p class="small text-white-50 mb-0">
                      Gather any active prescription sheets or health IDs for
                      immediate handovers.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <div class="feature-icon bg-danger">
                    <i class="fas fa-phone-volume"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="feature-info">
                    <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-1">
                      4. Tele-First Aid Guidance
                    </h6>
                    <p class="small text-white-50 mb-0">
                      Keep your audio channel free. Our certified squad will
                      walk you through CPR or basic first aid if required.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section py-5">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <div class="services-badge mb-3">
          <span class="dot-teal me-2"></span> Emergency FAQ
        </div>
        <h2 class="services-main-title mb-5">
          Critical Questions Regarding Emergency <br />
          Medical Dispatches
        </h2>

        <div class="faq-card-wrapper shadow-sm border">
          <div class="faq-scroll-area">
            <div class="faq-item">
              <h6 class="faq-question">
                Q1: Are ambulance dispatches completely free under medical
                insurance policies?
              </h6>
              <p class="faq-answer">
                A: Most verified multi-speciality insurance covers emergency
                trauma dispatches completely. Our team automatically handles
                documentation during the hospital intake cycle.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h6 class="faq-question">
                Q2: How does the location tracker route vehicles effectively?
              </h6>
              <p class="faq-answer">
                A: Our systems employ real-time advanced geofencing protocols to
                route the nearest on-road vehicle instantly, completely avoiding
                regular traffic clusters.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
              <h6 class="faq-question">
                Q3: Can I coordinate blood donor reserves prior to arriving at
                the facility?
              </h6>
              <p class="faq-answer">
                A: Yes. By interacting with the dynamic Blood Match interface,
                our centralized networks pre-alert target blood registries
                before the transport unit clears your coordinates.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('includes/footer') %>
  </body>
</html>
